        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GVCBIA, Biarritz Knob with Grande Victorian Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOur jaws dropped when we saw the Grande Victorian Plate With Biarritz Knob. The beautifully cut Biarritz Crystal Knob paired with the exquisitely detailed Grande Victorian Plate is simply stunning. It is perfect for stately homes and gives off an air of richness. Choose from an array of lovely finishes. The Grande Victorian Biarritz Knob has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-grande-victorian-series\"><b>Grande Victorian Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GVCBIA Grande Victorian Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Grande Victorian Plate is made out of solid forged brass and the Biarritz Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Biarritz Knob with Grande Victorian Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Depth:  2.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GVCBIA-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262319\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GVCBIA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grande Victorian Plate With Biarritz Knob",
                "description": "Grandeur GVCBIA, Grande Victorian Plate With Biarritz Knob - Our jaws dropped when we saw the Grande Victorian Plate With Biarritz Knob. The beautifully cut Biarritz Crystal Knob paired with the exquisitely detailed Grande Victorian Plate is simply stunning. It is perfect for stately homes and gives off an air of richness. Choose from an array of lovely finishes. The Grande Victorian Biarritz Knob has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
